<title>POLAND: BORYSZEW OCT NET RISES TO PLN 1.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>BORYSZEW OCT NET RISES TO PLN 1.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.75 vs   1.38</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.62 vs   2.30</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.63 vs   2.45</p>
<p> Sales		   12.40 vs  14.19</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     6.21 vs   5.96</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	10.44 vs   9.33</p>
<p> Operating profit    12.61 vs  10.92</p>
<p> Sales		   81.22 vs  86.24</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish chemical firm is Boryszew SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
